**GSAP solves the transform-origin nightmare.** Native SVG rotations default to the canvas origin (0,0) rather than element centers, with browsers handling this inconsistently. GSAP harmonizes behavior across IE, Opera, Firefox, Safari, and Chrome automatically. The implementation pattern:

