## Design recommendations and synthesis

Bringing together mathematical theory, technical implementation, visual design, and algorithmic approaches yields a **clear development roadmap** for your three-gear rotation puzzle.

**Start with the dependency graph as your architectural foundation.** Define the graph structure first in your data model, then build all rotation logic around it. This separation of concerns allows easy modification if you later add gears or change relationships. Use adjacency lists for storage, BFS for rotation propagation, and parent tracking to prevent infinite loops.

