\item \textbf{Dimensional reduction:} Full PDE state space $\rightarrow$ few parameters feeding $K(m)$
\item \textbf{Conservation by construction:} Transfer function form guarantees mass/energy balance
\item \textbf{Special function efficiency:} AGM quadratic convergence ($\sim$5 iterations to machine precision)
\end{enumerate}

