\subsubsection{Squarity Index}

The difference between pole and zero vector lengths: $|p| - |z| \in \{0, 1\}$

This discrete, dimensionless index exhibits monotonic relationship with \textbf{carbon conversion efficiency} (CCE). Due to discreteness, the index is calculated for specific bins or intervals.

